  "pre_gate_answer": "# Briefing\n\n## Question\n**In which month of 2022 did INREV publish its _Due Diligence Questionnaire for Funds of Funds and Multi Manager_?**\n\n## Finding\n**The provided evidence does not establish the publication month.**\n\n## Evidence Assessment\n- The evidence references a different INREV document: **_Due Diligence Questionnaire for Non-Listed Real Estate Investment Vehicles_**.\n- That document notes:\n  - original launch in **April 2007**\n  - updates in **2010**, **2014**, and **2018**\n- It also mentions separate questionnaires for:\n  - **fund of funds and multi-manager mandates**\n  - **real estate debt vehicles**\n- However, it **does not state the 2022 publication month** for **_Due Diligence Questionnaire for Funds of Funds and Multi Manager_**.\n\n## Relevance of Remaining Material\n- Other supplied materials relate to **ILPA due diligence questionnaires** and broader private markets DDQ content.\n- These sources are **not directly relevant** to identifying the 2022 publication month of the INREV document in question.\n\n## Conclusion\n**Based solely on the supplied evidence, the month in 2022 cannot be determined reliably.**",
